When an owner departs, follow only an explicit successor assignment with remit and effective scope for these questions. Preserve the historical decision author. A manager mention or directory rename is not acceptance of responsibility. Leave owner null and retain a routing question when authority is unresolved. Renamed project aliases map identity but never create independent supporting evidence.
